vars: {
  d2-config: {
    layout-engine: elk
    theme-id: 103
  }
}

direction: right

Governance: {
  g1: Pick NIST / ISO 27001 / CIS baseline
  g2: Document internal network policy
  g3: Define risk appetite & exposure limits
}

Audit: {
  a1: Export full rule inventory
  a2: Usage analysis (90–180 days)
  a3: Detect shadow & duplicate rules
  a4: Identify ownership gaps
}

Simplify: {
  s1: Remove unused & shadowed rules
  s2: Consolidate overlapping rules
  s3: Replace IPs with named objects
  s4: Enforce naming convention
}

Lifecycle: {
  l1: Define request & approval workflow
  l2: Mandatory expiry on every rule
  l3: Annual review cycle
  l4: Deploy Source of Truth (Nautobot / NetBox)
}

Governance -> Audit
Audit -> Simplify
Simplify -> Lifecycle
